{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060430/extras/20a2851d26267e3daf5916291bfa28af.avif?t=1759438915\" width=1424 height=552 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Step into the shoes of Ja\u015b, an ordinary boy who suddenly finds himself in a magical land filled with Polish legends and myths. The power over this world has fallen into the hands of the sinister Master Twardowski, and the land is sinking into chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your task is to travel through vibrant locations \u2013 from the streets of Warsaw, through dark forests, all the way to the hills beneath Mount Giewont. Meet legendary heroes, face mighty beasts such as the basilisk and the Wawel dragon, and make choices that will shape the fate of the entire land.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060430/extras/d452979cde8c52235db2ac117ae00610.avif?t=1759438915\" width=1024 height=256 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Journey across <strong>colorful locations</strong> \u2013 from the streets of <strong>Warsaw</strong>, through dark forests, to the slopes beneath <strong>Mount</strong> <strong>Giewont</strong>. Encounter <strong>legendary</strong> <strong>characters</strong>, confront fearsome creatures like the <strong>basilisk</strong> and the <strong>Wawel</strong> <strong>dragon</strong>, and make <strong>decisions that will change the destiny of the realm</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Uncover legends, meet fascinating figures, solve puzzles</strong>, and discover the many faces of Polish folklore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060430/extras/846902b3d04d050bb5a3cfff0b329406.avif?t=1759438915\" width=1024 height=256 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique world inspired by Polish legends and myths</strong> \u2013 experience our culture in a new, interactive form.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A 3D narrative adventure game with logic puzzles</strong> \u2013 combining exploration, puzzle-solving, and story-shaping choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decisions that matter</strong> \u2013 shape the land\u2019s destiny with your choices and unlock different endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encounters with legendary characters and monsters</strong> \u2013 from the Wawel dragon, through basilisk, to witches beneath Mount Giewont.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A rich, fairy-tale atmosphere</strong> \u2013 immerse yourself in a magical world full of mysteries and local folklore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learning through play</strong> \u2013 discover Polish stories and legends in an engaging, interactive way.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4060430?t=1759438915","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060430/8fff03d4da9fb2567ad4fdac4a86146b21198b8b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759438915","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060430/54ebc11459d9b75df8250718d8b2c97ea307e1a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759438915","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060430/54ebc11459d9b75df8250718d8b2c97ea307e1a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759438915","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67